desc(
	mode: "ssa"
	language: "python"
	title: "数据流：Python XPath 拼接"
	title_zh: "数据流：Python XPath 拼接"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "ssa-python-xpath-query"
	risk: "xpath-injection"
	cwe: "CWE-643"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
把外部字符串拼进 XPath 可以改变查询条件，读到未授权节点。

### 风险类型
xpath-injection

### 影响
参数不是常量，且不是函数自身的参数对象时告警。常量配置和纯参数传递不报。

### 检测方式
SSA 上匹配调用，保留非常量且非 param 的实参。
### 参考
- CWE-643
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
使用 XPath 变量绑定，或对引号和括号做严格转义。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://bad.py": <<<POS
def bad(tree, request):
    return tree.xpath(request.args.get("name"))

POS
	"safefile://ok.py": <<<NEG
def ok(tree):
    return tree.xpath("//user")

NEG
)
xpath(*?{!opcode: const && !opcode: param} as $dyn) as $call
alert $dyn for {
	level: "high",
	title: "数据流：Python XPath 拼接",
	title_zh: "数据流：Python XPath 拼接",
	message: "数据流：Python XPath 拼接",
	risk: "xpath-injection",
}
